			<param index="7" name="upper_rest_angle" type="float" />
			<param index="8" name="collector_width" type="float" />
			<description>
				Sets [param pantograph] of [param vehicle] as its model builds it ([code]TAnimPant[/code]): where the lower arm stands in the vehicle's own space, the arms' lengths, the horizontal offset between their ends and their angles lowered, and the slider's width the model gives for a vehicle whose FIZ declares none. Measured by whoever draws the vehicle. The server raises the pantograph on its step; a model rebuilt sets it again and the raise is kept.
			</description>
		</method>
